@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #365879
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EEF4F8
hide empty members
title U04 类图：观察者、策略与模型适配器
class EventHub <<Subject>> {
  +subscribe(type, observer)
  +unsubscribe(type, observer)
  +notify(event)
}
interface EventObserver <<Observer>> {
  +observer_id: str
  +on_event(event)
}
class CognitionObserver <<ConcreteObserver>> {
  +on_event(event)
}
class RealtimeObserver <<ConcreteObserver>> {
  +on_event(event)
}
class PerceptionService {
  +visible_agents(event): AgentId[]
}
class MemoryService {
  +record(observation)
  +retrieve(context): Memory[]
}
class DecisionJobStore {
  +create_unique(task)
  +claim(): DecisionJob
}
class DecisionService <<Context>> {
  +decide(context): ActionProposal
}
interface DecisionStrategy <<Strategy>> {
  +decide(context): ActionProposal
}
class RuleDecisionStrategy <<ConcreteStrategy>>
class LLMDecisionStrategy <<ConcreteStrategy>>
interface ModelGateway <<Target>> {
  +generate(request): ModelResponse
}
class ProviderAdapter <<Adapter>> {
  +generate(request): ModelResponse
}
class FakeModelGateway <<TestDouble>>
class ProviderClient <<Adaptee>> {
  +provider_specific_request(...)
}
EventHub o-- "0..*" EventObserver : 注册/通知
EventObserver <|.. CognitionObserver
EventObserver <|.. RealtimeObserver
CognitionObserver --> PerceptionService
CognitionObserver --> MemoryService
CognitionObserver --> DecisionJobStore
DecisionService --> DecisionJobStore : 读取任务
DecisionService --> DecisionStrategy : 选择/调用
DecisionStrategy <|.. RuleDecisionStrategy
DecisionStrategy <|.. LLMDecisionStrategy
LLMDecisionStrategy --> ModelGateway
ModelGateway <|.. ProviderAdapter
ModelGateway <|.. FakeModelGateway
ProviderAdapter --> ProviderClient : 转换协议
note bottom of EventHub
每个进程各有EventHub。
组间广播由Redis Streams承担。
认知副作用提交后再ACK。
end note
note bottom of DecisionStrategy
返回同一个ActionProposal契约。
失败切换规则，禁止直接修改世界。
end note
@enduml
